/* Every word the app shows, in English, French and Arabic for the office,
   and in six languages for cleaners. Labels are looked up by key: u(key)
   for the office, t(key) for the cleaner app. */

/* ------------------------------------------------------------
   Country settings. Everything country-specific lives here so
   nothing is hard-coded in the screens. Adding a country is a
   line in this table, not a code change.
   ------------------------------------------------------------ */

/* ------------------------------------------------------------
   Manager and customer interface strings.
   The cleaner app has its own dictionary (T) with five languages.
   This one covers the office screens.
   ------------------------------------------------------------ */

