 lg_link:'Privacy and terms',lg_title:'Privacy and terms',lg_thecompany:'The company',lg_settingsnote:'what you tell staff and customers about their data',lg_template:'A starting point. Have it checked against the law where you operate before relying on it.',lg_who_t:'Who looks after your information',lg_who:'{c} decides what is collected and why, and is responsible for it. The software only stores it on their behalf.',lg_what_t:'What is collected',lg_what:'Names, phone numbers and email addresses. For staff: working hours, the location when checking in to a job or clocking in, photographs taken on the job, and messages. For customers: properties and access notes, bookings, invoices, payments and messages.',lg_why_t:'Why',lg_why:'To plan and carry out cleaning work, to show the customer what was done and when, to pay staff correctly, to invoice, and to deal with complaints. Location is recorded only at check-in and clock-in, not continuously, unless a person chooses to share it.',lg_where_t:'Where it is kept',lg_where:'On the devices that use the app and, when online saving is switched on, in a database run by Supabase. Customers can only see their own information. Staff cannot see prices, pay or other people’s details.',lg_keep_t:'How long',lg_keep:'For as long as the working relationship lasts. Invoices and pay records are kept for as long as tax law requires. Everything else can be removed on request.',lg_rights_t:'Your rights',lg_rights:'You can ask {c} for a copy of everything held about you, ask for it to be corrected, or ask for it to be erased. Laws such as the Data Protection Act in Mauritius and the GDPR in Europe give you these rights. Contact:',lg_terms_t:'Terms of use',lg_use_t:'Using the app',lg_use:'Each person signs in with their own access and keeps it private. Do not use someone else’s access or try to reach information that is not yours.',lg_photos_t:'Photographs',lg_photos:'Photographs taken on a job are a record of the work and cannot be changed once saved. Do not photograph people, personal documents or anything unrelated to the work.',lg_liab_t:'Responsibility',lg_liab:'{c} is responsible for the cleaning work and for the information it records. The software is provided as is.',pd_btn:'Their data',pd_title:'Personal data',pd_intro:'Everything held about this person. They have the right to a copy, and to have it erased.',pd_export:'Download a copy',pd_erase:'Erase',pd_exported:'Copy downloaded.',pd_erased:'Erased.',pd_removed:'removed',pd_formerstaff:'Former staff',pd_keepstaff:'Erasing removes contact details, documents, messages and location history, and revokes their access. Hours and pay stay, without the name, because tax law requires them.',pd_keepcust:'Erasing removes contact details, notes, messages, quotes and property access codes, and revokes their access. Invoices stay, because tax law requires them.',pd_confirmstaff:'Erase this person’s personal data? Contact details, documents, messages and location history are removed for good. Pay records are kept without the name.',pd_confirmcust:'Erase this customer’s personal data? Contact details, notes, messages and access codes are removed for good. Invoices are kept.',

